:: day0_training [nobr]
<<locationImage "training_yard" "Training Yard">>
<h2>⚔ Training Yard</h2>
<p>Empty this morning. But something was left on the weapon rack.</p>

<<if not $d0_npc_aldric_gift>>
<div class="interaction-card main">
  <<npcPortrait "aldric" "Aldric">>
  <h4>🗡 Something New on the Rack</h4>
  <p>A practice sword you don't recognise. Smaller. Lighter. A note beside it.</p>
  [[Investigate|day0_npc_aldric_gift]]
</div>
<<else>>
  <p class="empty-note">The yard is empty and quiet. The gift is already yours.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Return to Palace Hub|day0_hub]]
</div>
